<title>UK: First Tech finance director to join Babcock.</title>
<headline>First Tech finance director to join Babcock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's First Technology Plc said on Thursday its finance director, Nigel Young, had resigned to become finance director at Babcock International Group Plc.  </p>
<p>The company said Young would leave First Technology following the release of preliminary results in July and join Babcock, an engineering and materials handling firm.</p>
<p>Separately, Babcock said Young would succeed Erik Porter, who planned to retire.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
